STEP 1 — DELTA
- NEW `api.sipgate.com/v2/doc` — live SwaggerUI (swagger-ui-bundle + swagger-initializer.js + keycloak-logout.js), reachable via `GET /docs` → 308 → `/v2/doc` (200); loads spec `/v2/swagger.json`; initializes OAuth: realm `third-party`, clientId `sipgate-swagger-ui`, implicit flow, redirect `https://api.sipgate.com/v2/doc/oauth2-redirect.html`; `oauth2-logout.html` also live (200).
- NEW `login.sipgate.com` third-party realm client `sipgate-swagger-ui`: authorize (both token flow) → 303 broker `keycloak-internal-thirdparty-to-sipgate-apps-client` + session_code (client registered, redirect_uri exact-validated); `response_type=code` → 302 `unauthorized_client` "Standard flow is disabled for the client" (implicit-only); token endpoint accepts public-client format (`invalid_grant` on bogus code).
- CHANGED `api.sipgate.com/metrics` — 403 empty-body with `x-sipgate-was-nq-request: true` (WAF-tagged; descriptive only).
- NO_DELTA: bundles unchanged (`main-D04St2Sb.js` prod+dev), swagger.json still 144 paths; 17 root routes (`/actuator /status /v1 /internal /admin ...`) → uniform 404/403.

