The swagger.json confirms the live OAuth2 scheme — implicit flow against the third-party realm with a massive scope set. Let me pull the two remaining swagger doc pieces (`swagger-initializer.js` for the exact client_id, `keycloak-logout.js` referenced by the doc page) to close the loop on the swagger OAuth chain.
